WEBVTT

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:11.950
别动。
Don't move.

00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:17.300
告诉我……
Tell me...

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:19.100
你到底是从哪里来的？
Where did you come from?

00:00:20.301 --> 00:00:22.601
你：（不挣开）我是楼上宴会的摄影师。你的眼睛怎么回事？
You: (Don't pull away.) I'm the photographer for the party upstairs. What's wrong with your eyes?

00:00:22.701 --> 00:00:28.001
摄影师。
A photographer.

00:00:33.749 --> 00:00:36.549
眼睛？那是你害的。
The eyes? That's your doing.

00:00:36.749 --> 00:00:39.549
Harland 把订婚提前了。还有十分钟。
Harland moved the engagement up. Ten minutes.

00:00:42.897 --> 00:00:45.197
你：我害的？什么意思？
You: My doing? What do you mean?

00:00:45.297 --> 00:00:51.097
你真的不知道。
You really don't know.

00:00:56.345 --> 00:00:59.645
Mate。这就是你对我的意义。
Mate. That's what you are to me.

00:00:59.845 --> 00:01:02.645
Alpha，电梯在动。
Alpha, the elevator is moving.

00:01:05.493 --> 00:01:07.793
你：Mate？先解释清楚。我再决定。
You: Mate? Explain first. Then I'll decide.

00:01:07.893 --> 00:01:11.693
也对。我来解释。
Fair. I'll explain.

00:01:11.893 --> 00:01:17.693
一匹狼，一个Mate。那就是你。
One wolf. One Mate. That's you.

00:01:18.941 --> 00:01:21.741
来。我会回答一切。
Come. I'll answer everything.

00:01:24.441 --> 00:01:27.741
现在我身上都是你的气味。
Your scent is on me now.

00:01:28.089 --> 00:01:30.389
你：把我的手覆在他的拳头上
You: Lay my hand over his fist

00:01:30.489 --> 00:01:36.789
小心。我快撑不住了。
Careful. I'm barely holding on.

00:01:42.037 --> 00:01:45.337
你的气味会把他们引到这里。
Your scent will lead them here.

00:01:45.537 --> 00:01:47.337
Selene。来电了。
Selene. Incoming call.

00:01:50.685 --> 00:01:52.985
你：Selene是谁？她为什么给你打电话？
You: Who is Selene? Why did she call you?

00:01:53.085 --> 00:02:00.385
Selene。我今晚本该娶她。
Selene. I was supposed to marry her tonight.

00:02:05.633 --> 00:02:08.933
这是我的领地。在这里没人能碰你。
This is my territory. No one touches you here.

00:02:09.133 --> 00:02:12.933
你的气味会慢慢平息。我早该提醒你的。
Your scent will settle. I should have warned you.

00:02:13.281 --> 00:02:15.581
你：跟着他走进起居室
You: Follow him into the living room

00:02:15.681 --> 00:02:20.981
进来。
Come in.

00:02:28.229 --> 00:02:33.029
闻到你气味的那一刻，我就离开了订婚现场。
I walked out on the engagement when I caught your scent.

00:02:34.229 --> 00:02:35.529
你在发抖。
You're shaking.

00:02:35.877 --> 00:02:38.177
你：我不冷。我为什么在发抖？是你搞的吗？
You: I'm not cold. Why am I shaking? Is this you?

00:02:38.277 --> 00:02:42.577
对。是我。
Yes. That's me.

00:02:42.777 --> 00:02:48.077
会过去的。靠近我。
It'll pass. Stay close.

00:02:49.825 --> 00:02:52.125
待在我身后。
Stay behind me.

00:02:52.325 --> 00:02:56.125
Arkwright小姐，他不见任何人。
Miss Arkwright, he's not receiving anyone.

00:02:58.473 --> 00:03:00.773
你：我要见她。让她进来。
You: I want to see her. Let her in.

00:03:00.873 --> 00:03:06.673
如你所愿。
As you wish.

00:03:13.921 --> 00:03:15.721
原来是真的。
So it's true.

00:03:15.921 --> 00:03:19.221
她不用你操心，Selene。
She is not your concern, Selene.

00:03:21.069 --> 00:03:23.369
你：走到他面前，把手放在他的脸颊上
You: Step to him and lay my hand on his cheek

00:03:23.469 --> 00:03:29.269
你靠近了。
You came closer.

00:03:35.017 --> 00:03:37.817
那是什么？
Then what is it?

00:03:39.017 --> 00:03:41.317
坐我旁边。
Sit with me.

00:03:43.665 --> 00:03:45.965
你：过来。抱住我。
You: Come here. Hold me.

00:03:46.065 --> 00:03:50.365
永远。
Always.

00:04:02.613 --> 00:04:05.913
三十年了。而你，就在这里。
Thirty years. And you're here.

00:04:06.261 --> 00:04:08.561
你：抬头：今晚我留下。
You: Look up: I'm staying tonight.

00:04:08.661 --> 00:04:14.961
那就留下。我护着你。
Then stay. I've got you.

00:04:19.709 --> 00:04:22.509
Alpha，Harland 召集了长老。就在今晚。
Alpha. Harland called the elders. Tonight.

00:04:23.709 --> 00:04:27.009
他们今晚想要你。他们得不到你。
They want you tonight. They won't have you.

00:04:28.857 --> 00:04:31.157
你：等等。这些长老是谁？他们为什么要找我？
You: Wait. Who are these elders? Why do they want me?

00:04:31.257 --> 00:04:37.557
长老审判我们这一族。
The elders judge our kind.

00:04:41.305 --> 00:04:44.605
你是人类。他们害怕这意味着什么。
You're human. They fear what that means.

00:04:46.305 --> 00:04:48.605
来。站在我身边。
Come. Stand beside me.

00:04:51.453 --> 00:04:53.753
你：挽住他的手臂，和他一起走出去
You: Take his arm and walk out with him

00:04:53.853 --> 00:04:59.653
你的手。放在那儿别动。
Your hand. Stay there.

00:05:04.901 --> 00:05:07.701
上车。我与你同在。
Get in. I'm with you.

00:05:07.901 --> 00:05:10.701
他们会考验我。随他们。
They'll test me. Let them.

00:05:14.049 --> 00:05:16.349
你：怎么考验你？如果你失败了会怎样？
You: Test you how? What happens if you fail?

00:05:16.449 --> 00:05:20.749
他们会要你。我拒绝。
They'll demand you. I refuse.

00:05:20.949 --> 00:05:26.249
输了，我就失去整个族群。
Lose, and I lose the clan.

00:05:27.497 --> 00:05:29.797
他们会称之为叛逆。
They'll call it treason.

00:05:31.497 --> 00:05:34.797
那你就是向自己的血脉宣战。
Then you declare war on your blood.

00:05:36.645 --> 00:05:38.945
你：上前一步，牵起他的手
You: Step forward and take his hand

00:05:39.045 --> 00:05:44.345
你来了。
You came.

00:05:52.093 --> 00:05:54.893
待在我身边。
Stay beside me.

00:05:57.093 --> 00:05:58.893
他们来了。
They're coming.

00:05:59.241 --> 00:06:01.541
你：那声嚎叫。是Selene吗？告诉我实话。
You: That howl. Is it Selene? Tell me the truth.

00:06:01.641 --> 00:06:07.441
不。不是Selene。
No. Not Selene.

00:06:14.689 --> 00:06:16.989
Arkwright家的狼。他们来早了。
Arkwright wolves. They're early.

00:06:18.689 --> 00:06:21.489
靠近我。我来结束这一切。
Stay close. I'll end this.

00:06:21.837 --> 00:06:24.137
你：打开车门，坐进去
You: Open the car door and climb in

00:06:24.237 --> 00:06:30.037
好。跟紧我。
Good. Stay close.

00:06:36.285 --> 00:06:40.085
Arkwright家的狼已经在路上了。
Arkwright wolves are already on the road.

00:06:41.785 --> 00:06:44.085
今晚，我带你回家。
Tonight, I take you home.

00:06:44.433 --> 00:06:46.733
你：他们会追上我们吗？告诉我实话。
You: Will they catch us? Tell me the truth.

00:06:46.833 --> 00:06:52.633
他们可以。但今晚不行。
They can. Not tonight.

00:06:58.381 --> 00:07:00.681
Arkwright家的狼跑得很快。
Arkwright wolves run fast.

00:07:02.381 --> 00:07:05.181
到了。下车。快。
We're here. Out. Now.
